    "backstory": "Once a high-rolling golf caddy, \"Nine Iron\" Ike saw his career go to the rough when Subchain City's DRIP dried up. Now, he uses his knowledge of angles and trajectories to scavenge and defend his corner of the wasteland, always looking for an edge, be it a lucky bounce or a well-placed bludgeon. He's seen better days, but he's not about to let the apocalypse break his stride.",
